|mp=[[To be confirmed|TBC]]
|party=[[To be confirmed|TBC]]|region=England|county=[[Somerset]]|european=|elects_howmany=One|towns=[[Frome]], [[Midsomer Norton]], [[Radstock]], [[Peasedown St John]]|image2=[[File:South West England - Frome and East Somerset constituency.svg|255px|alt=Map of constituency]]|caption2=Boundary of Frome and East Somerset in South West England}}'''Frome and East Somerset''' is a [[List of UK Parliament constituencies|constituency]] of the [[House of Commons of the United Kingdom|House of Commons]] in the [[Parliament of the United Kingdom|UK Parliament]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Mumby |first=Daniel |date=2023-07-02 |title=Seat boundaries for next general election confirmed |url=https://www.somersetlive.co.uk/news/somerset-news/final-boundaries-somerset-seats-next-8564083 |access-date=2024-02-24 |website=Somerset Live |language=en}}</ref> It was created in 2024 from the former constituencies of [[Somerton and Frome (UK Parliament constituency)|Somerton and Frome]] and [[North East Somerset (UK Parliament constituency)|North East Somerset]] as a result of the [[2023 Periodic Review of Westminster constituencies]]. It will first be contested at the [[2024 United Kingdom general election|2024 general election]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=The 2023 Review of Parliamentary Constituency Boundaries in England – Volume one: Report – South West {{!}} Boundary Commission for England |url=https://boundarycommissionforengland.independent.gov.uk/2023-review/2023-review-volume-one-report/the-2023-review-of-parliamentary-constituency-boundaries-in-england-volume-one-report-south-west/ |access-date=2023-07-17 |website=boundarycommissionforengland.independent.gov.uk}}</ref>

== Boundaries ==
{{maplink|raw={{Wikipedia:Map data/Frome and East Somerset (UK Parliament constituency)}}|frame=yes|text=Map of boundaries from 2024}}
The constituency consists of the following:

* The District of [[Bath and North East Somerset]] wards of: Bathavon South; Midsomer Norton North; Midsomer Norton Redfield; Peasedown; Radstock; Westfield.
* The [[Somerset Council]] electoral divisions of: Frome East; Frome North; Frome West; Mendip Central and East; Mendip Hills (part); Mendip South (most).<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=New Seat Details - Frome and East Somerset |url=https://www.electoralcalculus.co.uk/fcgi-bin/calcwork23.py?seat=Frome+and+East+Somerset |access-date=2024-02-24 |website=www.electoralcalculus.co.uk}}</ref>

More informally, it covers the town of [[Frome]] and surrounding rural areas as well as smaller communities to the South of [[Bath, Somerset|Bath]], including [[Midsomer Norton]], [[Radstock]] and [[Peasedown St John]].<ref name=":0" />

